  "review": "The shared positivity lemma supports both the reflected transport and carrier existence arguments. The original theorem statements and named argument hV are preserved. The new lemma was checked with a negative V and depends on propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. The 26 old public axiom reports are byte-identical. Both targets, two focused checks, ThirteenCarrierComplete and NativePositiveSourceConstruction passed in baseline and final runs.",
  "limitations": [
    "ThirteenFreshSeed now emits an unusedVariables warning for the preserved named argument hV.",
    "The direct client ThirteenCorrectedStrong failed in both runs before elaboration because CurrentPositiveZero2011.olean was missing; no whole-build claim.",
    "Targets were rebuilt with other cached imports; no fresh dependency closure was established.",
    "A preliminary malformed negative-V helper example failed and its log was overwritten; neither its original source nor its log is preserved and that attempt cannot be independently audited. The corrected probe and its log are preserved.",
    "The preliminary clear-hV test succeeded but still emitted the warning; the trial source was overwritten and restored to the final compiled source.",
    "The additional client and helper timing files record the Lean argv and exit status; their separate shell-wrapper commands were not preserved. run.py and the results JSON record the main batch commands, environment setup and statuses.",
    "Timings are single observations under concurrent load."
  ]
}
